Multi-Proxy Gateway plugin for OPNsense.

Turns remote SOCKS5, HTTP CONNECT and Shadowsocks proxies into standard OPNsense gateway
interfaces using tun2socks. Route specific devices, VLANs, or subnets
through any proxy using standard firewall rules — no client-side
configuration needed.

Features:
- Multiple concurrent proxy connections, each as a separate gateway
- SOCKS5, HTTP CONNECT and Shadowsocks support
- Automatic tun interface creation, gateway registration and outbound NAT
- Health checking with backup-proxy failover, gateway force-down,
  and Gateway Group support
- Speed tests, traffic statistics and a diagnostics page
- Full OPNsense MVC integration with GUI, API, and configd

